# Bonds of Mythril (crystalWar 59), the Prog 6 zone-in from any zone (Task 5 review Minor 2): a level 99 Warrior in
# Castle Zvahl Keep [S] with The Truth Lies Hid completed and the WotG mission Adieu, Lilisette current (missions as
# the main flow); the quest accepted at Prog 6 with the Zvahl Passkey (GMs). The main and #rivals flows reach the
# Metalworks at Prog 6 only by 213's setPos from Bastok Markets [S]; here a warp from Castle Zvahl Keep [S]: 972 all
# the same (left open), finished: Prog 7, setPos into North Gustaberg [S]. Prog 7: the Metalworks from the Keep:
# nothing.
lists Metalworks/onZoneIn/1 Metalworks/onEventFinish/972
char zone=CastleZvahlKeepS pos=-382.757,-51.999,-95.783 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.TheTruthLiesHid completed
quest CrystalWar.BondsOfMythril accepted
charvar Quest[7][59]Prog 6
keyitem ZvahlPasskey
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
warp 68.365,-13.999,-4.562 Metalworks open # from Castle Zvahl Keep [S] at Prog 6: 972, left open
finish                                  # Prog 7; setPos into North Gustaberg [S]
warp -382.757,-51.999,-95.783 CastleZvahlKeepS
warp 68.365,-13.999,-4.562 Metalworks   # from Castle Zvahl Keep [S] at Prog 7: nothing
